+- title: Frame commands, DI15 to DI12 (datasheet Tables 1 to 11)
+  note: The top four bits of every 16-bit frame on SDI. In the mode frames, DI11 = 1 makes the part take the rest of the frame's settings; with DI11 = 0 it keeps the previous ones.
+  columns:
+  - DI15–DI12
+  - Command
+  - Rest of the frame
+  rows:
+  - - '0000'
+    - Continue in the current mode
+    - Ignored. In auto modes the channel steps on; in manual mode it stays
+  - - '0001'
