+  - - '0010'
+    - Auto-1 mode (programmed list)
+    - DI10 restart at the lowest listed channel, then DI06 to DI00 as in manual mode
+  - - '0011'
+    - Auto-2 mode (channel 0 to the last)
+    - DI10 restart at channel 0, then DI06 to DI00 as in manual mode
+  - - '0100'
+    - GPIO program
