+| ESP32-S3 into the part, low | The part needs 0.4 V maximum (VA = 3 V). The ESP32-S3 gives at most 0.1 × VDD, 0.33 V | Met, with little margin |
+| Part into the ESP32-S3 (SDO), high | VBD − 0.2 V, 3.1 V minimum at 200 µA, against 0.75 × VDD, about 2.5 V | Met |
